[ti:You're a Grand Old Flag]
[ar:George M. Cohan]
[01:00.00]You're a grand old flag
[01:00.25]You're a high-flying flag
[01:00.50]And forever in peace may you wave
[01:00.75]You're the emblem of the land I love
[01:01.00]The home of the free and the brave
[01:01.25]Every heart beats true
[01:01.50]For the red, white and blue
[01:01.75]Where there's never a boast or brag
